.TH covert_send6d 8 2026-02-07 THC IPv6 ATTACK TOOLKIT
.SH "نام (NAME)"
.B covert_send6d

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
covert_send6d [-k key] interface file

.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.nf

  -k key     decrypt the content with Blowfish-160

Writes covertly received content to FILE.
